<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST- S.African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST- S.African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major South African company results expected next week include the following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY----PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE---------PVS--</p>
<p>MON  Times Media YR EPS  303.0	  302.0-304.0   258.0</p>
<p>MON  Times Media YR div  133.5	  132.0-135.0   113.0</p>
<p>WED  Foschini    YR EPS  98.1	   93.1-105.0    112.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Foschini awards capitalisation shares instead of a dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
